{"t":"CEG","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Constellation Energy Corporation","ko":"컨스텔레이션에너지","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Independent Power Producers","employees":15291,"hq":"Baltimore, MD, United States","website":"https://www.constellationenergy.com","summary_en":"Constellation Energy Corporation produces and sells energy products and services in the United States. The company operates through five segments: Mid-Atlantic, Midwest, New York, ERCOT, and Other Power Regions. It offers electricity, natural gas, energy-related products, and sustainable solutions. The company has approximately 31,676 megawatts of generating capacity consisting of nuclear, wind, solar, natural gas, and hydroelectric assets. It serves distribution utilities, municipalities, cooperatives, and commercial, industrial, public sector, and residential customers. The company was incorporated in 2021 and is headquartered in Baltimore, Maryland.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Constellation Energy Corporation은 미국에서 에너지 제품과 서비스를 생산 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 중부 대서양, 중서부, 뉴욕, ERCOT 및 기타 전력 지역의 5개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 전기, 천연가스, 에너지 관련 제품 및 지속 가능한 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 원자력, 풍력, 태양광, 천연가스, 수력 자산으로 구성된 약 31,676 메가와트의 발전 용량을 보유하고 있습니다. 이는 유통 유틸리티, 지방자치단체, 협동조합, 상업, 산업, 공공 부문 및 주거 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2021년에 설립되었으며 메릴랜드주 볼티모어에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":278.265,"mcap":97840349184.0,"pe":22.36857,"fpe":20.731081,"peg":null,"ps":2.8566525,"pb":2.9909391,"ev_ebitda":12.631,"div":0.62,"beta":1.127,"hi52":380.78,"lo52":228.63},"fin":{"rev":34250000384.0,"rev_g":0.454,"eps_g":0.745,"gross":0.25241,"op":0.17944999,"net":0.12759,"roe":0.18344,"fcf":-5374000128.0,"cash":603000000.0,"debt":23387000832.0,"de":70.786,"eps":12.44,"feps":13.4226},"own":{"short":0.0334,"inst":0.84189004,"insider":0.00348},"analyst":{"n":23,"mean":337.8974,"median":345.0,"high":399.0,"low":238.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.64,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":14,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"